# Change data capture: a product update in MySQL flows through a CDC connector and Kafka to an indexer
# that updates Elasticsearch. Separately a user searches through the search API. Layout pins the user
# and search API on the bottom row and aligns db and cdc.
title Search indexing pipeline
app[App] -> db[MySQL] : update product
db -> cdc[CDC Connector] : binlog
cdc -> kafka[Kafka] : product-changed
kafka -> indexer[Indexer] : consume
indexer -> es[Elasticsearch] : update document
user[User] -> search[Search API] : search
search -> es : query
es --> search : results
search --> user : 200
pin user 0,2
pin search 3,2
rank db cdc
